    "text": "In the adjacent diagram, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CP</mi></math> represents wavefront and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BP</mi></math> corresponding two rays. One particular condition on <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> for destructive interference at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> between the ray <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BP</mi></math> and reflected ray&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OP</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cosθ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mi>nd</mi></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/459162.JPG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 179px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Path difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>CO</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>OP</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>OPcos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>OP</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>OP</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OPcos&#952;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math></p><p><br />Path difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>cos&#952;</mi></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>cos&#952;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>dcos&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>dcos&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>dcos&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
